  "answer_text": "**wakehealth.edu** is the official website for **Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist** (formerly known as Wake Forest Baptist Health), a nationally recognized, fully integrated academic medical center and health system based in Winston-Salem, North Carolina. \n\nAn overview of what you can find and do on the site includes:\n\n### 1. Key Services & Features\n* **Academic Medical Center:** It serves as the clinical enterprise of the **Wake Forest University School of Medicine** and is the academic core of **Advocate Health** (the third-largest non-profit health system in the United States).\n* **Patient Portal (MyAtriumHealth):** The website hosts the login and registration for **MyAtriumHealth** (powered by Epic MyChart). Patients can use this secure portal to:\n  * View test results, medical history, and clinical notes.\n  * Schedule, reschedule, or cancel appointments.\n  * Send secure messages directly to healthcare providers.\n  * Pay bills and request prescription renewals.\n* **Find a Doctor & Locations:** You can search for physicians, specialists, and primary care locations, as well as the main Atrium Health Wake Forest Baptist Medical Center and its five affiliated regional community hospitals.\n\n### 2. Major Components of the System\n* **Clinical Care:** Includes a Level I Adult Trauma Center and a Level I Pediatric Trauma Center.\n* **Research & Education:** Home to the Wake Forest School of Medicine.\n* **Innovation Quarter:** A collaborative hub in downtown Winston-Salem focused on life sciences, research, and tech startups.\n\n### 3. Contact and Support Information\n* **MyAtriumHealth Support:** If you need assistance with your patient portal account, you can call their toll-free support line at **855-799-0044** or email **MyAtriumHealth@atriumhealth.org**.\n* **General Inquiries:** The website's \"Contact Us\" page provides details for scheduling appointments, billing questions, and reaching patient/family relations.\n\n*If you are looking for a specific service, trying to log in, or need help finding a particular resource on their site, let me know how I can assist!*",
